OL,3,GNEWSA'Hot summer has made growing
OL,4,Agrapes easy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vineyard owner has said the recent
OL,7,Fheatwaves have made growing grapes
OL,8,F"really easy".
OL,10,FHalfpenny Green Winery in Bobbington,
OL,11,Fon the Staffordshire-Shropshire border,
OL,12,Fis a 30-acre site with 16 varieties of
OL,13,Fgrape.
OL,15,FHistorically, picking at the site
OL,16,Fbegins in late September. However, last
OL,17,Fyear marked the first time ever that it
OL,18,Fbegan in August and this year it is due
OL,19,Fto begin on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
