OL,3,GNEWSA'Hot summer has made growing
OL,4,Agrapes easy'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Although they're designed for a
OL,7,Fslightly cooler climate... as soon as
OL,8,Fit gets hotter, [the vines] just enjoy
OL,9,Fit even more," said vineyard owner
OL,10,FClive Vickers. "It's been really easy
OL,11,Ffor us, they've really enjoyed the
OL,12,Fweather."
